					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Dammit, but not dammit. I had an idea for a tale wherein Bright becomes everyone; I didn't know it had already been done, and by the kindly doctor himself<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-170471-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup> This took a more humorous tone than I would've gone with, but dammit, I was amused. Just one question, and I don't care if/how it gets answered, but my curiosity is there: in this scenario, does Bright now have a hive mind, or are there now 7 billion + Brights?</p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-170471-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. I know he's not a doctor, and that there's a difference between the character and the author. Please don't hate me for this word choice.</div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
